# e2e/kw-granted-tags.spec.ts — a keyword tag only for a keyword the card did not print, and the
# summoning-sickness hatch at rest, in the operator's own window: declaring blockers.
# alice (human, seat 0) is the active player with Memnite already attacking bob. bob (ai seat,
# driven by the second browser) holds:
#   - Serra Angel ("Flying, vigilance") wearing Arcane Flight: flying printed AND granted, vigilance
#     printed — no tag at all, and it still floats.
#   - Grizzly Bears wearing Arcane Flight ("Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has flying."): flying
#     granted only — a Flying tag.
#   - Hill Giant, summoning sick: Forge's `Sickness` holds until bob's own next turn, so it wears
#     the hatch while it blocks.
# activephase is Declare ATTACKERS for the reason `w54-b-two-blockers.state` gives.
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=COMBAT_DECLARE_ATTACKERS
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=
humanbattlefield=Memnite|Attacking
humanlibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
humangraveyard=
aihand=
aibattlefield=Serra Angel|Id:102;Arcane Flight|AttachedTo:102;Grizzly Bears|Id:101;Arcane Flight|AttachedTo:101;Hill Giant|SummonSick
ailibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
aigraveyard=
